    "kind": "hand_lead_x_road_buffer_minus_buildings",
    "description": "At each hotspot, buffer nearby LION wet-edge (or synthetic) road segments into curb/lane/center bands, subtract building footprints, and extrude by Decision Desk HAND lead cm. Not a 2D SWE free surface.",
