      "corridor_wet_edges.geojson (LION \u00d7 HAND)",
      "building_footprints_sample.geojson (or synthetic blocks)",
      "decision_desk HAND depth_series_cm by lead"
    ],
    "honesty": "Research curb/street screening geometry \u2014 NOT photogrammetry, NOT hydraulic routing, NOT NWS."
  },
  "honesty": "Research HAND/MRMS lead-frame screening in MapLibre 3D curb/street buffers. NOT photogrammetry street-truth. NOT official guidance. HAND cm \u2260 FloodNet sensor metres. SFINCS remains optional Advanced / non-peer.",
